Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: timesave
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, chrony
Description: Persist system clock to disk
 Replicates the clock-saving behaviour of systemd-timesyncd for systems
 using chrony as the NTP daemon. Writes /var/lib/systemd/clock every 60
 seconds and on shutdown, ensuring an accurate boot-time timestamp.
